19:Tad1,Nanosoft Technologies looking for a versatile SEO & Digital Media Specialist with 2–3 years of experience, adept at both strategic SEO/link building and social media management. The ideal candidate will elevate our international education clients' online presence through innovative AI-powered SEO strategies, backlink outreach, compelling content creation, and engaging social media campaigns using tools like Canva and CapCut.
 
Key Responsibilities:
 
SEO & Link Building 
● Execute white-hat link building strategies—including HARO pitches, guest posts, niche edits, and outreach to high-authority domains (DA 50+). 
● Generate link-worthy educational content and coordinate with content teams for SEO optimization. 
● Manage backlink campaigns, monitor link health, and produce weekly performance reports. 
● Use SEO metrics (DA, DR, Trust Flow, organic rankings) to guide strategy. 
● Stay updated with Google’s guidelines and manage ethical paid placements as needed. 
 
Off-Page & Junior SEO Tasks 
● Perform off-page SEO tasks such as blog posting, article submissions, and social bookmarking to enhance domain visibility. 
● Support content distribution across educational platforms and networks. 
 
AI-Driven Content Strategy 
● Use AI tools (e.g., ChatGPT, Surfer SEO, Jasper, Writesonic) for ideation, drafting, and optimizing SEO content for education domain. 
● Collaborate on content calendars, ensuring educational relevance and SEO best practices.
 
Social Media & Creative Media Production 
● Develop and execute data-driven social media strategies aligned with SEO goals across platforms (LinkedIn, Instagram, Facebook, etc.). 
● Create and publish visual and short-form content using Canva, CapCut, and similar tools. 
● Manage community engagement and monitor social performance metrics (engagement, reach, ROI).
 
Required Qualifications & Skills 
● 2–3 years of experience, ideally with international clients in the education sector. 
● Proven track record in link building (including HARO, guest posts) using tools like Ahrefs, SEMrush, BuzzStream, Pitchbox. 
● Solid understanding of off-page SEO tactics (blogging, submissions, bookmarking). 
● Proficient in AI content creation tools, with strong writing and editing skills. 
● Hands-on with social media platforms, scheduling, engagement tracking, and creative tools (Canva, CapCut). 
● Familiarity with SEO analytics tools: Google Analytics, Search Console, and SEO platforms (Ahrefs, SEMrush). 
● Excellent communication, project management, and collaboration skills across global teams.
 
📩 To Apply: Send your resume to jobs@nanosofttek.com
📌 Subject Line: Mention the position you’re applying for.1a:T4ff,🚀 Exciting News – We’re Expanding Our Team! 🚀
We’re thrilled to share that Jylix Tech is growing, and we’re on the lookout for brilliant minds to join us on this journey. If you’re passionate about building enterprise-level applications and love working with cutting-edge technologies, we’d love to connect with you!
We’re Hiring: .NET Full Stack Software Engineer
What you’ll do:
Build responsive, scalable web applications (frontend & backend).
Design and secure robust APIs (authentication, authorization, rate limiting, DDoS protection).
Embrace DevOps practices with CI/CD pipelines & containerization (Docker/Kubernetes).
What we’re looking for:
Expertise in .NET Core 8 & 9, C#, ASP.NET Core, Entity Framework Core.
Strong database skills (SQL Server, MySQL).
Hands-on experience with modern frontend frameworks.
API development (REST & GraphQL) & API security expertise.
Experience with AI modules & payment gateway integration.
A problem-solver with a collaborative mindset.
Details:
 📍 Location: Remote from Lahore or anywhere in Pakistan (flexible hours)
 🕒 Job Type: Full-Time
If you’re ready to take the next step in your career and be part of something exciting, send your resume and cover letter to hr@jylixtech.com1b:T4c4,🌐 Job Opportunity: .NET Core + Angular Developer
📍 Location: #Remote (Pakistan Only)
💼 Experience: 2+ Years
💰 Salary: Rs.60,000 – Rs.70,000/month
📆 Type: Full-Time Contract (Long-Term)
🗓 Workdays: Thursday to Monday

🔧 Responsibilities:
- Design, develop, and maintain scalable web applications using .NET Core and Angular.
- Build and consume RESTful APIs.
- Work with MS SQL Server and Entity Framework for data operations.
- Collaborate with the team to deliver high-quality, maintainable solutions.

✅ Requirements
- Minimum 2 years of hands-on experience with .NET Core.
- Proficiency in Angular (preferably latest versions).
- Strong knowledge of Entity Framework and MS SQL Server.
- Solid experience in developing and integrating REST APIs.

💡 Preferred (Nice-to-Have)
Familiarity with Docker, Kubernetes, or AWS.
Experience with Redis for caching and performance optimization.

🌟 Why Join Us?
💻 100% Remote — work from anywhere in Pakistan
📅 Fixed schedule (Thursday to Monday)
🚀 Work with modern tech and scalable architectures
🤝 Supportive and collaborative team environment

